    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In the Arena of Judgement, the victor claims not only triumph but their freedom\u2026</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Soul Slasher</i> is a top-down, close-combat 1v1 duelist experience. Easy to learn but hard to master.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601700/extras/173bb2c5bbbff0b47554f9800cc4706e.poster.avif?t=1754573029\" width=610 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601700/extras/173bb2c5bbbff0b47554f9800cc4706e.webm?t=1754573029\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601700/extras/173bb2c5bbbff0b47554f9800cc4706e.mp4?t=1754573029\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy to learn controls.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 3 different character classes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1v1 close-combat duellos.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Randomized arena layout every match.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Randomized Buffs, Debuffs, Traps.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ranked, Casual and Private Matches.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Butter smooth performance with great visuals.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Short match times.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601700/extras/d3c48ba9ddeddf74a2c7698504d57891.poster.avif?t=1754573029\" width=610 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601700/extras/d3c48ba9ddeddf74a2c7698504d57891.webm?t=1754573029\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601700/extras/d3c48ba9ddeddf74a2c7698504d57891.mp4?t=1754573029\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose the class that reflects &quot;you&quot; the best and get into the arena!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601700/extras/0beceaad01dd07df72bea742991418ad.poster.avif?t=1754573029\" width=610 height=254 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601700/extras/0beceaad01dd07df72bea742991418ad.webm?t=1754573029\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601700/extras/0beceaad01dd07df72bea742991418ad.mp4?t=1754573029\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Show your combat and mind tricks to other souls and slash them for your freedom</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601700/extras/2dfd134210300facc77b2cdc8c897596.poster.avif?t=1754573029\" width=610 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601700/extras/2dfd134210300facc77b2cdc8c897596.webm?t=1754573029\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601700/extras/2dfd134210300facc77b2cdc8c897596.mp4?t=1754573029\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
